  "doctrine": {
    "summary": "Large NATO army on the Black Sea flank, mid-way through replacing Soviet-era and domestic designs (TR-85, MLI-84, TAB) with Piranha V, Cobra II, Abrams and K9. Hosts the French-led NATO battlegroup and the Mihail Kogalniceanu air base; routinely deals with Russian drone debris and airspace incursions near the Danube.",
    "squad_size": 9,
    "fireteam": "9-man squad in two teams plus leader.",
    "tactics": [
      "mechanised defence along river lines",
      "mountain troops (Vanatori de munte) for Carpathian terrain",
      "Spike ATGM teams and AG-7 anti-armour",
      "artillery-heavy fires (HIMARS, LAROM, K9)",
      "coastal and Danube security patrols"
    ],
